WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.834
-It is time to play the
game that's sweeping the nation.

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:05.667
It's "Is There a 'Stache
Under That Mask?"

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:10.167
-"Is There a 'Stache
Under That Mask?"

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:13.133
-This is a game where we pick
a random audience member

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:17.267
and guess if there is
a 'stache under their mask.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:21.334
So, please welcome tonight's
audience member, Sharif Hessen.

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:22.400
Sharif?

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.267
-Welcome.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:37.300
-Hey.
-Thank you for being here.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.667
-How's it going?
Thanks for having me.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:40.601
-Please, have a seat there.

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:42.234
Now, am I saying it right?
Is it Sharif? Sharif?

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:43.434
-Sharif.
-Sharif.

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:46.567
Alright, Sharif Hessen.
Where are you from?

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:49.100
-I'm from Edison, New Jersey.
-Edison, New Jersey.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.667
Now, that is --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:54.701
That is all I can ask you.

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:56.133
Now we have to figure out
if you have a

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:58.300
'stache under that mask.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.267
Quest, you go first.
One question for Sharif.

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.434
-Sharif, at Starbucks,

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:07.801
would you order hot chocolate
with whipped cream?

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:11.100
-Um...I don't order hot
chocolate.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.334
-Wow!

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:14.501
-There's that.

00:01:14.501 --> 00:01:16.167
-"There's that."
-Yeah.

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:21.434
"There's that."

00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:22.801
Quest, what's your guess?

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:25.434
-I don't think he has a 'stache.
-I got you. Okay.

00:01:25.434 --> 00:01:27.434
[ Both chuckle ]

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:31.000
Tariq, your turn.
What's your question?

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.968
-If you were planning to
observe Movember,

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:38.033
would that involve much of
a transformation of

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:40.667
your upper lip?

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:43.267
-Hmm.

00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:44.767
Remind -- What's Movember?

00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:48.501
-Movember is when you spend the
month of November not shaving.

00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:50.901
So you grow
your facial hair out.

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:52.133
-Okay.

00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:56.033
-Why isn't it like Novem-beard?
-Look, listen.

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:59.100
Let's focus, Sharif.
-Yes, let's focus.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:03.968
-So, do I -- I guess I prepare,
like, mentally, you know.

00:02:03.968 --> 00:02:05.767
-This is a
"yes"-or-"no" question.

00:02:05.767 --> 00:02:07.367
If you observe Movember --
-He answered you.

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:08.834
Tariq, there's your answer.

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:11.367
-No, no, no. I do not accept.

00:02:11.367 --> 00:02:14.267
If you observe Movember,
which means you're

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.534
going to grow
your facial hair out --

00:02:16.534 --> 00:02:18.367
-He's pressuring you.
You already answered.

00:02:18.367 --> 00:02:20.067
You're fine.
-You don't shave for a month.

00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:21.200
Would your --

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.534
-Can we turn
his microphone off, please?

00:02:23.534 --> 00:02:27.400
-Do you use power tools, Sharif?
-Your honor, your honor!

00:02:29.501 --> 00:02:31.167
Alright.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:36.701
-I think he has a mustache.

00:02:36.701 --> 00:02:37.834
-What do you think?

00:02:37.834 --> 00:02:38.901
-I think he has
a mustache, Jimmy.

00:02:38.901 --> 00:02:39.934
-Okay.

00:02:39.934 --> 00:02:41.234
-Huh.

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:42.901
-I'm sitting
pretty close to you.

00:02:42.901 --> 00:02:45.701
-Yeah.
-I'm looking at the mask.

00:02:45.701 --> 00:02:47.834
You have a good head of hair.
-Thanks.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:51.734
-And you have decent eyebrows.

00:02:51.734 --> 00:02:52.968
-Thanks.

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:55.567
-Do the curtains match
the drapes, Sharif?!

00:02:55.567 --> 00:02:56.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.667 --> 00:02:58.667
[ Suspenseful music playing ]

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:10.300
-Alright. When people see you
on the street,

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.601
do they mistake you for

00:03:12.601 --> 00:03:15.601
Jonathan Lipnicki from
"Jerry Maguire"

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:19.000
or Freddie Mercury?

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.000
-Ooh!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.300
Um...I wear a mask
a lot lately, so --

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.300
-So people could think it's
Jonathan Lipnicki,

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.334
the child from "Jerry Maguire"?

00:03:28.334 --> 00:03:32.567
-Yeah, yeah. So, who knows?
You know?

00:03:32.567 --> 00:03:34.901
-I think that one busted him
wide open right there, Tariq.

00:03:34.901 --> 00:03:35.934
We got him.

00:03:35.934 --> 00:03:37.400
[ Drumroll ]
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.334
-I think there is
a 'stache under that mask.

00:03:40.334 --> 00:03:43.033
Sharif, you want to let us
see what's happening?

00:03:43.033 --> 00:03:47.634
-Is there a 'stache under
that mask?!

00:03:47.634 --> 00:03:50.334
[ Drumroll ]

00:03:50.334 --> 00:03:52.234
-Yeah!
♪♪

00:03:52.234 --> 00:03:55.367
Yeah!

00:03:55.367 --> 00:03:56.667
He's got a mustache.
It looks good, right?

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:58.167
-Yeah, it looks good, right?
-You look good, yeah.

00:03:58.167 --> 00:04:00.501
-Thank you, thank you.
-Thank you for playing.

00:04:00.501 --> 00:04:04.167
You've won this
Bluetooth-enabled smart mask.

00:04:04.167 --> 00:04:06.067
Thank you for playing.
What is this?

00:04:06.067 --> 00:04:09.300
This has been "Is There
a 'Stache Under That Mask?"

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.901
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show."

00:04:10.901 --> 00:04:11.968
Thank you very much.
-Thank you very much.

